  (text "VIN_RAW -> F1 -> D1 (reverse polarity) -> D2 TVS + C1/C2 -> U1 (5 V module) -> +5V rail.\n+5V feeds: servo buffer U4 VCC, optional 5 V sensor supplies (via solder jumpers), D3 -> DevKitC 5V pin (+5V_ESP).\n+3V3 is NOT generated on the carrier: it is the DevKitC on-board regulator output (capacity unverified; keep peripheral load small).\nPWR_FLAGs mark nets that are genuinely powered from connectors/diodes (ERC driver annotation only)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20.32 88.9 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "5f19287a-245b-583a-9312-8d02d766a18c")
  )
